    <title>
      <narrative xml:lang="en">Addressing Labor Exploitation in Fishing in ASEAN (ALFA)</narrative>
    </title>
    <description type="1">
      <narrative xml:lang="en">The ALFA project will strengthen the capacity of the Association of Southeast Asian Nations (ASEAN) sectoral bodies and member countries to coordinate and collaborate to address forced labor and abusive working conditions in the regions fishing industry. ALFA will focus on ASEAN regional policy implementation, and increased engagement with the private sector, worker organizations, and civil society to mitigate forced labor and trafficking, and improve working conditions for a more sustainable, responsible and resilient fishing sector.</narrative>
    </description>
